@startuml 08-outcome-lifecycle
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.iuml
title State and Outcome lifecycle of a Procurement
[*] --> queued : discovered
queued --> out_of_scope : goods category has no software
queued --> downloading : Gate turn (fresh)
downloading --> analysing : archive in hand
downloading --> no_tor_package : no zipId published
downloading --> error : transport failure
error --> queued : retried next Run (attempts < 3)
error --> abandoned : third failure
analysing --> tor_analysed : software, high confidence
analysing --> needs_review : low confidence or partial read
analysing --> analysis_failed : model could not read any candidate
analysing --> no_tor_in_archive : archive has no TOR
analysing --> [*] : not software, high - tombstone only
needs_review --> tor_analysed : admin approves
needs_review --> [*] : admin non-software or delete
tor_analysed --> [*]
note right of queued
  State groups
  Queued: queued, error
  Processing: downloading, analysing
  Completed: tor_analysed, needs_review,
    analysis_failed, no_tor_in_archive, out_of_scope
  Failed: no_tor_package, abandoned
end note
@enduml
